          "image_source": "images/page_9_image_2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.26,
            0.846,
            0.301
          ],
          "content": "How do we construct the petals so that they are of the maximum possible size within a given square?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.322,
            0.612,
            0.346
          ],
          "content": "**Repeating Units and Repeating Angles**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.347,
            0.454,
            0.371
          ],
          "content": "Construct the following figure."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.336,
            0.381,
            0.665,
            0.49
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_9_image_6.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.501,
            0.847,
            0.559
          ],
          "content": "In this figure, there is a single unit repeating itself. To construct this figure, we need to make exact copies of this unit in two different orientations."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.311,
            0.558,
            0.66,
            0.657
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_9_image_8.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.666,
            0.847,
            0.723
          ],
          "content": "In order to make exact copies, all the units must have the same arm lengths and the same angle between the arms. We can ensure equal arm lengths using a compass, but how do we ensure equal angles?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.723,
            0.804,
            0.743
          ],
          "content": "Let us develop a method to create an exact copy of a given angle."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.751,
            0.781,
            0.791
          ],
          "content": "Draw an angle. Create a copy of this angle using only a ruler and compass."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.817,
